1
00:00:06,096 --> 00:00:08,380
=Episode 5=

2
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:19,072
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

3
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:22,256
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

4
00:00:23,359 --> 00:00:23,960
Xi Yuan,

5
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,559
don't let your inner demon consume you.

6
00:00:26,199 --> 00:00:27,039
Jin Yunlie.

7
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,440
Come with me.

8
00:00:33,744 --> 00:00:36,220
♪Hard to forget the losses of the past♪

9
00:00:39,479 --> 00:00:40,719
Help me.

10
00:00:44,272 --> 00:00:47,230
♪The wind hasn't risen tonight.
Missing you might be an illness♪

11
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:50,272
♪The long misty rain scatters in haste♪

12
00:00:50,416 --> 00:00:55,320
♪Letting go may be love's last line♪

13
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,479
You're not left with nothing.

14
00:00:59,119 --> 00:00:59,840
The past

15
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:01,039
is behind you now.

16
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,520
What's in your world right now

17
00:01:04,159 --> 00:01:05,399
is the present and the future.

18
00:01:06,119 --> 00:01:06,920
Right.

19
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,759
I'm not left with nothing.

20
00:01:10,768 --> 00:01:13,390
♪Who can forget the dreams
once held and lost♪

21
00:01:14,540 --> 00:01:16,192
♪Petals on your shoulder reveal your charm♪

22
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,159
Xia Honglian,

23
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:20,400
my past may be full of darkness,

24
00:01:21,159 --> 00:01:23,680
but you can't destroy me
with those memories.

25
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:27,560
♪After the world fades away,
you alone stay in my sight♪

26
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:31,079
What's past

27
00:01:31,079 --> 00:01:32,480
is prologue.

28
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,000
Break!

29
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,680
Jin Yunlie,

30
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,640
so it was you just now.

31
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:42,799
Honglian!

32
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,519
Father!

33
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:46,799
How dare you!

34
00:01:46,799 --> 00:01:47,920
How dare you touch my father!

35
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,200
Let him go right now!

36
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,680
The Xia family's crimes are ironclad.

37
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,079
You're

38
00:01:51,159 --> 00:01:52,359
coming with us too.

39
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,400
What?

40
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,000
Heavens!

41
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:59,719
You've treated my family unfairly!

42
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,159
Unfairly!

43
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,319
Father!

44
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:06,640
Father!

45
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,240
Jin Yunlie,

46
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,400
today,

47
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:21,439
you have brought ruin

48
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,719
upon my family.

49
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:27,879
I will paint this arena red with blood!

50
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,039
What are you doing?

51
00:02:29,479 --> 00:02:31,120
Great Lord Qing Yuluo above,

52
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,759
I offer my blood

53
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:36,120
to summon your presence!

54
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,599
Qing Yuluo?

55
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:07,240
Oh my!

56
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,039
Qing Yuluo?

57
00:03:08,759 --> 00:03:11,199
The Second Prince of Longyuan Kingdom?

58
00:03:11,199 --> 00:03:11,800
Yes.

59
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,199
What's he doing here?

60
00:03:13,199 --> 00:03:14,120
Yeah, what for?

61
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:14,919
Qing Yuluo,

62
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,000
you colluded with the Xia family

63
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,599
and stirred up all this chaos,

64
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:22,560
yet your brother Qing Zeyuan
dares not show up?

65
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,759
Oh?

66
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,360
You mean that stubborn,
good-for-nothing royal brother?

67
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:32,240
After Longyuan's guardian deity died,

68
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,599
Longyuan was left without a protector,

69
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:35,439
desperate for shelter.

70
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,879
And he, with his rigid mind,

71
00:03:38,599 --> 00:03:41,400
refused to pledge allegiance
to the Great Demon Lord.

72
00:03:44,199 --> 00:03:46,120
So I had no choice but to replace him.

73
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:48,800
The Demon Lord is the most
malevolent force in this world.

74
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,800
The four kingdoms sealed him away

75
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:52,479
and made a pact a century ago.

76
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:55,159
Now you have broken that pact,

77
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,840
murdered your brother
to seize the throne,

78
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:59,680
turned to the Demon Lord,
and colluded with the Xia family.

79
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,520
What is your goal?

80
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:02,759
You want to know that?

81
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:04,520
Fight me one on one,

82
00:04:05,039 --> 00:04:06,080
and I'll tell you.

83
00:04:06,159 --> 00:04:06,840
Outrageous!

84
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:09,599
How dare you wreak havoc
in the Huyun Imperial Palace

85
00:04:09,599 --> 00:04:11,360
and provoke His Highness!

86
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:12,360
Seize him!

87
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,759
Yes, seize him!

88
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,879
A bunch of nonentities,

89
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:18,120
and you think you can stop me?

90
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:26,800
(Qing Yuluo.)

91
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,600
Great Demon Lord?

92
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:33,360
(Wipe this place clean for me.)

93
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,000
Understood.

94
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,000
Demon Spirit!

95
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:53,160
Demon Spirits have descended!

96
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,439
Demon Spirits have descended!

97
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:55,279
Help!

98
00:04:55,279 --> 00:04:56,439
Help us!

99
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,519
Jin Yunlie.

100
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,800
If you want to stop all this,

101
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:20,199
then face me and prove your worth.

102
00:05:20,199 --> 00:05:21,199
So arrogant.

103
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:22,399
Jin Yunlie, beat him up!

104
00:05:22,439 --> 00:05:23,519
Send him back where he came from!

105
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:24,759
You talk too much.

106
00:05:25,519 --> 00:05:26,399
Lou Jingou,

107
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,560
get her out of here.

108
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,040
Right away.

109
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,600
Hey! You...

110
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:29,399
Go, now!

111
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,439
In that case,

112
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,800
let's have a little sparring match.

113
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,759
No rules, to the death.

114
00:05:40,199 --> 00:05:41,000
Jin Yunlie,

115
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:44,319
Huyun has kept Xuanji Jade
for far too long.

116
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:46,120
Now,

117
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,000
it's time for a change.

118
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,600
You're delusional.

119
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,720
Am I?

120
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,279
Qing Yuluo,

121
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:10,600
I told you,

122
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:13,000
you don't have what it takes
to fight me.

123
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:14,600
So cool!

124
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,680
Crawl back to your own territory!

125
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,519
This demon blade devours souls
without a trace.

126
00:06:56,639 --> 00:06:58,399
Farewell, Jin Yunlie.

127
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:03,000
I missed.

128
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,600
Xi Yuan!

129
00:07:07,399 --> 00:07:08,040
Why did you...

130
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:11,920
Didn't I tell you?

131
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,160
You saved me,

132
00:07:13,879 --> 00:07:14,879
and I'd save you.

133
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,279
We're even now.

134
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,680
This woman...

135
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,120
Xi Yuan!

136
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,439
No way.

137
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,920
Now I have to forge a new puppet.

138
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,480
Great Demon Lord.

139
00:07:48,879 --> 00:07:50,639
Useless waste.

140
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:54,160
You wasted a drop of my blood,

141
00:07:54,759 --> 00:07:58,040
and you still couldn't kill that man.

142
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,399
My Lord, please stay your anger.

143
00:08:00,279 --> 00:08:02,079
Killing Jin Yunlie failed this time,

144
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,040
but I gained something valuable.

145
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,040
The princess of the Huangyan Clan,
who fled into exile years ago,

146
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:08,800
has shown up in Huyun.

147
00:08:09,639 --> 00:08:11,600
We can use this woman

148
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:14,120
to sow discord between Huyun
and Huangyan.

149
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,319
We can also use her

150
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,959
as leverage against Jin Yunlie.

151
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:21,480
Huangyan?

152
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:23,480
(How ridiculous.)

153
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:27,879
(In this world, no one
even knows your true identity.)

154
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,439
(After all these years,)

155
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:33,639
(we finally meet again.)

156
00:08:35,079 --> 00:08:36,759
No need to sow discord.

157
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,919
All you need to do is capture that woman

158
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,000
and bring her here.

159
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:12,032
♪My regret came too late,
I finally see your true face♪

160
00:09:12,980 --> 00:09:18,176
♪My shattered promises struggle,
how can I let go♪

161
00:09:19,860 --> 00:09:25,728
♪Stripped bare, tormented.
I flinch at every feeling♪

162
00:09:26,060 --> 00:09:32,048
♪Forced to yield,
I flee before I fall apart♪

163
00:09:33,792 --> 00:09:38,010
♪I hate your back,
endless, blank, and never clear♪

164
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:40,480
♪Watching me weep, yet you stay silent♪

165
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:47,072
♪I hate how you cast me aside,
yet no room for a word♪

166
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:51,232
♪I hate my silence, my fading self,
and my lack of spite♪

167
00:09:51,610 --> 00:09:53,504
♪Yet I still hope you'll save me♪

168
00:09:53,584 --> 00:09:57,040
♪By the end,
I'm just your leftover compromise♪

169
00:09:57,460 --> 00:10:00,288
♪All the excuses I made for you♪

170
00:10:03,184 --> 00:10:06,080
♪Proud yet humble, I loved you♪

171
00:10:06,780 --> 00:10:09,040
♪Just like before, nothing has changed♪

172
00:10:09,900 --> 00:10:14,096
♪I had no escape from
that heart-wrenching agony♪

173
00:10:14,992 --> 00:10:21,880
♪Love became my sin,
we once were whole and wild♪

174
00:10:22,919 --> 00:10:23,679
Xi Yuan,

175
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,679
I won't let you die.

176
00:10:28,900 --> 00:10:32,224
♪I hate your back,
endless, blank, and never clear♪

177
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:35,312
♪Watching me weep, yet you stay silent♪

178
00:10:35,936 --> 00:10:41,130
♪I hate how you cast me aside,
yet no room for a word♪

179
00:10:42,970 --> 00:10:48,736
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

180
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:55,328
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

181
00:10:56,464 --> 00:11:02,000
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

182
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:09,000
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
